# Notices

PermitProof is MIT licensed. See `LICENSE`.

The checklist does not copy the Municode compilation of the Seattle Municipal Code. Rule rows store short table-cell codes, section locators, and paraphrases of the published key, with the source URL and the date they were read (2026-11-23). Seattle's municipal code is public law. The City GIS zoning extract was not included. Parcel rows are synthetic.

